stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AVAILABLE : Initialized at base station dock

    AVAILABLE --> ASSIGNED : Matched to order (meets payload, range, 20% buffer)
    AVAILABLE --> CHARGING : Idle battery drops below charging threshold
    AVAILABLE --> MAINTENANCE : Routine inspection due / technician flag
    AVAILABLE --> OUT_OF_SERVICE : Critical hardware flaw identified

    ASSIGNED --> IN_FLIGHT : Pre-flight check passes, drone departs
    ASSIGNED --> AVAILABLE : Order cancelled prior to takeoff
    ASSIGNED --> MAINTENANCE : Pre-flight diagnostics fail (battery drop / sensor error)

    IN_FLIGHT --> AVAILABLE : Delivery finished, returned & docked with battery > 60%
    IN_FLIGHT --> CHARGING : Returned & docked with battery <= 60%
    IN_FLIGHT --> MAINTENANCE : In-flight anomaly detected, landed at recovery station

    CHARGING --> AVAILABLE : Battery reaches 100% capacity
    CHARGING --> MAINTENANCE : Charger fault / cell imbalance detected
    CHARGING --> OUT_OF_SERVICE : Permanent battery degradation

    MAINTENANCE --> CHARGING : Repair complete, routed to charging dock
    MAINTENANCE --> AVAILABLE : Maintenance cleared with full battery
    MAINTENANCE --> OUT_OF_SERVICE : Deemed non-airworthy

    OUT_OF_SERVICE --> MAINTENANCE : Overhaul initiated
